B.aU4=new A.u("street","[Set 31] I speak without a mouth on every corner; ignore me and pay a fine. What am I?","A traffic sign")
B.b0t=new A.u("street","Deep riddle #942 \u2014 I change color but never mood; red stops, green releases. What am I?","A stoplight")
